    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d31">

                <pb facs="0106" n="30" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg30"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 863.001F85/8a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to the Emperor </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The White House</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-11-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 22, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I beg of Your Majesty and the Imperial and Royal Family to accept the sincerest
                    sympathy of Mrs. Wilson and myself in the great loss which you have sustained in
                    the death of your illustrious uncle, for whom I entertained sentiments of high
                    esteem and regard. I also extend to Your Majesty the condolences of the
                    Government and people of the United States, and convey to you my best wishes for
                    your personal well-being and prosperity.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Woodrow Wilson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
